      "q": "1. Calculate the mass percentage of benzene (${{C}_{6}}{{H}_{6}}$ ) and carbon tetrachloride ($CC{{l}_{4}}$ ) if 22 g of benzene is dissolved in 122 g of carbon tetrachloride.",
