      "q": "7. Henry\u2019s law constant for $C{{O}_{2}}$\u00a0 in water is $1.67\\times {{10}^{8}}$\u00a0 Pa at 298 K. Calculate the quantity of $C{{O}_{2}}$\u00a0 in 500 ml of soda water when packed under 2.5 atm $C{{O}_{2}}$\u00a0 pressure at 298 K.",
