      "q": "21. Primary alkyl halide C\n4\nH\n9\nBr(a) reacted with alcoholic KOH to give\u00a0 compound (b) Compound (b) is reacted, with HBr to give (c) which is an\u00a0 isomer of (a). When (a) is reacted with sodium metal it give compound (d),\u00a0 C\n8\nH\n18\nwhich is different from the compound formed when n-butyl bromide is\u00a0 reacted with sodium. Give the structural formula of (a) and write the\u00a0 equations for all the reactions.",
